  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>Reuben Mace, grocer, is listed at No. 190 <ref target="civic?id=Queensberry%20Street">Queensberry Street</ref> in 1915 and 1920.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>Reuben Mace, grocer, is on the 1919 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 190 Queensberry Street. A Reuben Mace, ventriloquist, is on the 1928 roll at 171 Grattan Street. That record is not linked to this entry.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>Mrs Mary J. Hayton is at No. 188 and Mrs Nellie Lee at No. 192 in 1915, and Cornelius Mulligan and Abraham Bartick in 1920. <ref target="civic?id=Elizabeth%20Facey">Elizabeth Facey</ref>, confectioner, is three doors along at No. 184.</p>
      </div>
